{"t":"CTSH","n":"Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation","nKo":"인지 기술 솔루션 회사","ex":"NasdaqGS","cur":"USD","px":58.57,"chg":0.51,"chgPct":0.00878,"prev":58.06,"dayH":58.82,"dayL":57.58,"w52H":87.03,"w52L":37.08,"vol":5161945,"avgVol":4946930,"mcap":26182572032,"pe":10.69,"fpe":9.33,"eps":5.48,"feps":6.28,"pb":1.78,"div":1.32,"divY":0.0225,"beta":0.83,"short":23180899,"shortPct":0.0519,"shortRatio":3.27,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Technology","sKo":"기술","i":"Information Technology Services","iKo":"정보 기술 서비스","city":"Teaneck","emp":359900,"web":"https://www.cognizant.com","sum":"Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation, a professional services company, provides consulting and technology, and outsourcing services in North America, Europe, and internationally. It operates through four segments: Financial Services; Health Sciences; Products and Resources; and Communications, Media and Technology. It provides services, such as artificial intelligence (AI) and other technology services and solutions, consulting, application development, systems integration, quality engineering and assurance, engineering research and development, application maintenance, infrastructure, security, and business process services and automation. It also offers AI-led automation, which includes advisory, and process and IT automation solutions designed to simplify and accelerate automation","sumKo":"전문 서비스 회사인 Cognizant Technology Solutions Corporation은 북미, 유럽 및 국제적으로 컨설팅, 기술, 아웃소싱 서비스를 제공합니다. 이는 4개 부문을 통해 운영됩니다: 금융 서비스; 건강 과학; 제품 및 리소스 커뮤니케이션, 미디어 및 기술. 인공 지능(AI) 및 기타 기술 서비스와 솔루션, 컨설팅, 애플리케이션 개발, 시스템 통합, 품질 엔지니어링 및 보증, 엔지니어링 연구 및 개발, 애플리케이션 유지 관리, 인프라, 보안, 비즈니스 프로세스 서비스 및 자동화와 같은 서비스를 제공합니다. 또한 자동화를 단순화하고 가속화하도록 설계된 자문, 프로세스 및 IT 자동화 솔루션을 포함하는 AI 주도 자동화를 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":19428000000,"ni":2290000000},{"y":2023,"rev":19353000000,"ni":2126000000},{"y":2024,"rev":19736000000,"ni":2240000000},{"y":2025,"rev":21108000000,"ni":2230000000}],"quarterly":[{"q